# USE=-rust: Fedora's config turns Rust on. Up to 7.3.1 init/Kconfig dropped
# it on its own whenever BTF met LTO; CachyOS lifted that restriction in
# 7.3.3 ("rust: Allow BTF generation with Rust + LTO"), and the Rust modules
# it then builds (rnull_mod, ...) get no BTF from pahole --lang_exclude=rust,
# which fails resolve_btfids at modfinal.
# CONFIG_RUST is not set
